  bootwright / completion powershell
      Generate a PowerShell completion script for PowerShell 7.7.0-preview.2 or later. Older
      versions lack the empty-result fix required to disable filesystem fallback and are
      rejected when sourcing the script.

  Usage
    bootwright completion powershell [flags]

  Command flags
      --no-descriptions  Omit completion descriptions

  Common flags
      --ascii       Use ASCII status markers
      --color       Select terminal colors (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --detail      Select human detail (values: compact, full) · default compact
      -h, --help    Show help for this command
      -o, --output  Select output mode (values: text, json, yaml) · default text
      --progress    Select progress animation (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --width       Set presentation width (0: automatic) · default 0

  Examples
    bootwright completion powershell
